.TH ZEX-SEARCH 1 "2026-06-27" "zex 5.0.0" "Zainium OS"
.SH NAME
zex-search \- search Zainium package repositories
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zex search
.RI [ \-\-tier
.IR N ]
.RI [ \-\-installed ]
.I <query>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zex search
queries all four package tiers simultaneously and displays matching
packages with their tier origin, version, and description.
.PP
Results are ordered by tier priority: T1 (Zainium native) first,
then T2 (Alpine), T3 (Void), T4 (Chimera). Within each tier, results
are sorted by relevance.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-tier INR
Restrict search to a specific tier (1\(en4).
.TP
.B \-\-installed
Show only already-installed packages that match the query.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
    zex search ripgrep
    zex search "fuzzy finder"
    zex search --tier 1 rust
    zex search --installed vim
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR zex (1),
.BR zex-install (1),
.BR zex-inspect (1)
